The J713 (MacBook Air 13", M4) headphone jack and microphones, from
aurora-silicon/alsa-ucm-conf-asahi 2f025d0 (Erik Bourget), which is after this
recipe's commit. Its speaker card file, "MacBook Air J713.conf", is left out:
nothing this repository ships protects the J713's speakers.

diff --git a/ucm2/conf.d/aop_audio/MacBook Air J713 High-Power Audio Interface.conf b/ucm2/conf.d/aop_audio/MacBook Air J713 High-Power Audio Interface.conf
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..6391ad5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/ucm2/conf.d/aop_audio/MacBook Air J713 High-Power Audio Interface.conf	
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+Syntax 7
+
+SectionUseCase."HiFi" {
+	Comment "Default"
+	File "/conf.d/aop_audio/3chan/HiFi.conf"
+}
diff --git a/ucm2/conf.d/macaudio/MacBook Air J713 Jack.conf b/ucm2/conf.d/macaudio/MacBook Air J713 Jack.conf
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..9450d6f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/ucm2/conf.d/macaudio/MacBook Air J713 Jack.conf	
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+Syntax 6
+
+# The J713 headphone jack, a sound card of its own (apple,j713-macaudio-jack),
+# apart from the speaker card "MacBook Air J713"
+SectionUseCase."HiFi" {
+	Comment "Default"
+	File "/conf.d/macaudio/cs42l84/HiFi-jack.conf"
+}
